{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "固定输入变量：从截线切线到偏导数",
    "goals": [
      "理解固定 y=y₀ 时曲面截线的几何含义与代数表达",
      "掌握固定输入变量后偏导数即截线切线斜率的计算与解释",
      "能够区分固定不同变量下的截面选择与偏导数方向"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "从三维曲面垂直截面过渡到二维截线函数图，对比空间与平面图形",
        "结合数值变化演示与代数推导，显式说明斜率与增量关系",
        "通过反例澄清特殊函数性质，建立对偏导数概念边界的理解"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 2,
        "label": "y₀",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.01
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-04-task-01",
        "prompt": "仍取 x=1，希望曲面上的点高度 z=2，请在非负范围内调节 y₀ 至正确数值以验证截面选择：",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "曲面方程为 z = x² + y²",
          "已知固定 x=1 且希望 z=2，代入可得 1 + y₀² = 2"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "回答正确！由 1 + y₀² = 2 解得非负 y₀ = 1。这验证了截面选择与曲面高度的对应关系，但请注意，单凭拖动滑块不能替代对偏导数代数推导的理解。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 1,
          "tolerance": 0.005
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "建立固定输入y=y₀的垂直截面与曲面截线概念",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "上一课我们固定了高度 z 来研究等高线。今天我们要研究对 x 的偏导数，这时需要固定输入变量 y，使其保持常数 y₀。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "曲面 z = x² + y² 与垂直截面 y = y₀",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2 + y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2 + y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "y",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "section.value",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              }
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "研究对 x 的偏导数",
                "items": [
                  "固定输入变量 y = y₀",
                  "截面内允许 x 变化，z 随之变化",
                  "y 在全过程中保持不变"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "请看三维曲面图，当前截面位置 y₀ 等于 0。在截面切出的抛物线上，y 被固定为 0，只有 x 可以自由变化，高度 z 随 x 的变化而变化。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察 y₀=0 时的垂直截面与曲面相交构成的截线"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "注意，旋转视角只是为了多角度观察图形，求导的本质是分析截线上 z 随 x 的变化率，而不是旋转相机的屏幕角度。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "移动截面至y₀=1并建立二维截线与切线对比图",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我把 y₀ 的值从 0 移动到 1。请观察，平移截面只是选择了我们要研究的具体曲线，移动 y₀ 本身并不是对 x 求导。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 1,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "当固定 y=1 时，原曲面方程转化为一元函数 g(x) 等于 x 平方加 1。若我们选择点 x₀=1，就对应空间中的点 P(1,1,2)。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g(x) = x^2 + 1 \\quad (y=1), \\quad P(1,1,2)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(1,1)} = g'(1) = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "请看新建立的二维函数图。这里横轴为 x，纵轴表示高度 z。图中标出了截线 z=x²+1 以及在 P 点处的切线 z=2x。切线斜率为 2，在 x=1 处与抛物线完美相切。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "supporting_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "固定y=1时的截线与切线（纵轴表示高度z）",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -15,
                    "max": 20,
                    "label": "z"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                    "label": "截线 z=x²+1"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "curve-02",
                    "expression": "(2)*(x)",
                    "label": "P处切线 z=2x"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "right_of",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "展示二维坐标系中截线与切线的几何关系",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-03",
      "purpose": "推导偏导数代数表达与几何斜率意义并澄清概念边界",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们在固定y等于1的截面上，对截线函数g(x)等于x平方加1求导，得到g撇(x)等于2x。当x等于1时，导数值g撇(1)等于2。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g'(x) = 2x \\implies g'(1) = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g'(x) = 2x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦截线函数的导数计算结果",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "结合切点坐标(1, 2)，利用点斜式得到切线方程z减2等于2乘以(x减1)，化简后为z等于2x。这里的斜率2代表高度z的增量与x增量之比，并不是屏幕像素角度。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "z - 2 = 2(x - 1) \\implies z = 2x \\quad (k = \\frac{\\Delta z}{\\Delta x} = 2)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "说明切线点斜式与斜率的代数比值含义",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "将这个过程推广到一般情况，对x求偏导数记作f_x(x0, y0)。在本例中f_x(x0, y0)等于2x0。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f_x(x_0, y_0) = \\lim_{\\Delta x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x_0 + \\Delta x, y_0) - f(x_0, y_0)}{\\Delta x} = 2x_0"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "注意，本例中偏导数与y0无关是x平方加y平方的特殊性质。如果是函数f等于x乘以y，对x求偏导数就等于y，偏导数值就会依赖y0。请不要将特例当成普遍规律。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f(x,y)=xy \\implies f_x(x_0,y_0) = y_0 \\neq \\text{常数}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-03-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "对比反例澄清偏导数对固定变量的依赖关系",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-04",
      "purpose": "总结固定变量求偏导法则并完成课后反求y₀检验",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "总结一下：当我们需要求多元函数对某一变量的偏导数时，实质就是固定其他所有输入变量，将曲面切出一个二维截线，然后在该截线上求一元导数。例如在点 P(1,1,2) 处，若要计算对 y 的偏导数，我们必须改调固定 x 为 1，并让 y 在截面上变化。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "固定变量求偏导法则与检验",
                "items": [
                  "法则：对某一变量求偏导，即固定其余输入变量，沿截线求一元导数",
                  "示例：在 P(1,1,2) 求对 y 偏导，需固定 x=1，沿 y 方向求导",
                  "理解检查：课后在非负范围内反求 y₀ 使得高度 z=2"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "总结固定输入变量求偏导的法则与理解检查",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "现在请你完成课后应用练习：仍取 x=1，若希望曲面上截线对应的点高度 z=2，请在非负范围内调整 y₀，使高度达标并验证截面选择。请注意，找到数值仅是几何直观的检验，真正掌握偏导数还需要结合代数求导与方向分析。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "布置课后反求 y₀ 练习并指出概念边界",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "本课学习了固定输入变量y=y₀的几何含义：通过垂直截面截出截线，将多元函数化为一元函数，在特定点求导得到切线斜率，即对x的偏导数。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
      "section-02-moment-03-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
